# Islas Escarcha, floor 1 (C7, contract 53), 28 x 22, a CAVE (the Exit Wisp works): BIG pale ICE slabs (`ice_<i%2><j%2>`), crystal-vein walls on the back sides and low snow drifts on the front sides, ice pillars,
# tufts of frost-grass (the wild tiles). The EAST mouth (27,5) comes from Ruta 19's island (spawn `east`), the WEST mouth (1,16) leads to Ruta 20's islet: floor 1 is the way ACROSS the islands, three chambers joined by corridors; the rope ladder (20,11) goes down
# to floor 2 (the optional puzzle: Aurowl). A Prime Salve, an Ultra Crystal and a sign.
@map islas_escarcha_1
@size 28 22
@interior no
@cave yes
@area islas_escarcha
@bg 0
@surf yes
@encounters grass rate=14
  echowing 40 44 25
  echolet 40 44 5
  belubub 38 42 25
  plattypuzz 38 42 20
  lazatee 38 41 15
  barnacub 38 42 10
@end
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 2 creatures of this table wander the whole walkable floor (grass included); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 2 table=grass area=cdefg period=1800
@spawn east 26 5 W
@spawn west 2 16 E
@spawn ladder 20 12 S
@legend
  .  tile=none
  a  tile=none object=snow_drift
  b  tile=none object=cwall
  c  tile=frost_tuft
  d  tile=ice_11
  e  tile=ice_10
  f  tile=ice_00
  g  tile=ice_01
  h  tile=ice_01 object=ice_pillar
  i  tile=ice_01 object=snow_drift
  j  tile=ice_11 object=snow_drift
  k  tile=ice_11 object=ice_pillar
  l  tile=ice_10 object=ice_pillar
  m  tile=ice_01 item=ultra_cristal
  n  tile=ice_10 object=snow_drift
  o  tile=ice_11 object=ice_mouth
  p  tile=ice_01 door=rope_ladder
  q  tile=ice_00 object=sign interact=look text=esc1.sign
  r  tile=ice_10 object=ice_mouth
  s  tile=ice_00 object=snow_drift
  t  tile=ice_00 object=ice_pillar
  u  tile=ice_11 item=prime_salve
  v  tile=ice_11 item=disc_19
